jobs.description:
About us

Integrisoft
is a software company established in 1999, focused on product development, custom software, and solutions for public administration. We are the leading provider of local tax software solutions in Romania.
Our team is growing, and we’re looking for a Junior .NET Developer
to join the team responsible for maintaining and continuously improving one of our established software products.
This is a great opportunity for someone at the beginning of their career who wants to gain hands-on experience working on a real-world enterprise application and learn from experienced developers.

Who you are

Graduate of a degree in Computer Science, Informatics, Cybernetics, Automation, or other related field;
Interested in starting or developing your career in software development;
H ave a good understanding of programming fundamentals and Object-Oriented Programming ;
Able to understand existing code and investigate problems step by step;
Structured and analytical approach to problem solving ;
Attention to detail and a quality-oriented mindset ;
Good communication and teamwork skills ;
Responsible, organized, and willing to learn .

What you'll do

As a Junior .NET Developer
, you will work with experienced developers on the maintenance and continuous improvement of an established enterprise software application.
Your responsibilities will include:
Analyzing reported issues and understanding their root causes;
Understanding existing application code and business logic;
Implementing fixes and small enhancements;
Developing and maintaining application modules;
Working with C# and ASP.NET
;
Working with Microsoft SQL Server
and SQL queries;
Working with web technologies such as JavaScript, jQuery and AJAX
;
Testing and debugging your changes;
Investigating and resolving software issues;
Participating in the entire process from requirements analysis to development and testing;
Writing and maintaining technical documentation;
Collaborating with other developers and team members;
Gradually taking ownership of increasingly complex tasks as you gain experience.

Requirements:

Basic knowledge of C#
;
Understanding of Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
concepts;
Basic knowledge of SQL
and relational databases;
Familiarity with web development concepts;
Basic knowledge of HTML, CSS and JavaScript
;
Analytical thinking and problem-solving skills;
Ability to learn and understand an existing software system.

Nice to have

Academic, personal, internship, or freelance programming experience;
Experience with ASP.NET / WebForms
;
Experience with Microsoft SQL Server
;
Familiarity with Web Services / APIs
;
Familiarity with jQuery or AJAX
;
Familiarity with Git or TFVC
;
Familiarity with Azure DevOps Server
;
Familiarity with Agile methodologies
;
Previous experience maintaining or working with an existing application.

You don't need to know all of the technologies above. A solid programming foundation and the motivation to learn are more important.

Tech stack

Backend:
C#, ASP.NET, WebForms, Web Services / APIs
Frontend:
JavaScript, jQuery, AJAX, HTML, CSS
Database:
Microsoft SQL Server
Reporting:
SQL Server Reporting Services (SSRS)
Version control:
Git and TFVC
DevOps:
Azure DevOps Server (on-premises)
Development:
Visual Studio

What we offer

Opportunity to start and grow your career in software development;
Mentoring and support from experienced developers;
Hands-on experience with a real-world enterprise software product;
Exposure to the complete software development lifecycle
Friendly and collaborative working environment;
Team-building activities;
Private healthcare through MedLife;
Tea and coffee;
Fruit Days 🍎;
Short Friday.

Work mode

Full-time
Hybrid
Office located near Obor Square, Bucharest – 5-minute walk from Obor metro station

If you're looking for an opportunity to start your career, learn from experienced developers, and work on software used in real-world business processes, we'd love to meet you.

Come and join Integrisoft!

Show more

Show less

Seniority level

Entry level

Employment type

Full-time

Job function

Engineering and Information Technology

Industries

Software Development

